================================================================================================
6. v2.0 baseline summary (config C)
================================================================================================
Compute   : 65,536 INT8 MACs = 64 cores x 1024 (32x32 systolic), 2.0 GHz worst-case
Peak      : 262 TOPS dense INT8/FP8, 524 TOPS 2:4-sparse, 1049 TOPS INT4 2:4-sparse
Memory    : 128 MB SRAM, 384-bit LPDDR5X-8533 = 410 GB/s raw
Power     : 56 W typical (60% util, Tj 105 C), 80 W at 100% util; TDP class 65 W
Efficiency: 2.8 TOPS/W dense at typical duty, 5.6 TOPS/W in 2:4-sparse units
Two-die D : 524 TOPS dense, 1049 TOPS 2:4-sparse, 112 W typical

