================================================================================================
SKU                          cores    MACs  Dense    2:4      DRAM  P typ   TDP Segment
                                             TOPS   TOPS bits/GB/s      W     W
Neo 262 (full die)              64  65,536    262    524 384/ 410   56.1    65 Premium L2+/L3 central-compute companion
Neo 196                         48  49,152    197    393 384/ 410   44.3    45 L2+ surround ADAS, hands-off highway
Neo 131                         32  32,768    131    262 256/ 273   31.5    30 L2+ front + surround, forced-air ECU
Neo 65 (yield recovery)         16  16,384     66    131 256/ 273   20.7    25 L2 front camera + DMS; still ~21 W: not a passive part
Same package, same software, one qualification; price tiers by cores enabled. The 16-core bin is still ~21 W (uncore + die leakage), so the passive-cooled mandate segment needs a small die, not a bin.
Gen 2 small die for the mandate segment (AEBS/LDWS/DDAWS): 16 cores, 2 x 64-bit LPDDR5X, ~75 mm2, ~12 W, reusing the core, NoC, island and compiler.
